<InfoLayout title="About" description="Learn why CalcFino Tools was created and how its free pace calculators are designed.">
  <p><strong>CalcFino Tools makes common endurance calculations fast, understandable and private.</strong> The site focuses on the numbers runners and swimmers repeatedly need: pace, speed, finish time, race splits and practical training ranges.</p>
  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>Time arithmetic is simple in principle but awkward in practice because minutes use base 60 while distances may be measured in miles, kilometers, meters or yards. Small rounding mistakes can grow across a long race. CalcFino handles the conversion consistently and shows the assumptions behind each result.</p>
  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>Calculators run directly in the browser. We favor transparent formulas, useful ranges and clear caveats over false precision. Pages are reviewed for usability on phones and desktop screens, and related tools are linked so that a result can lead naturally into race or training planning.</p>
  <h2>What we cover</h2>
  <p>CalcFino Tools provides free calculators across four categories:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Running &amp; Pace:</strong> Race pace, finish time, training zones, treadmill conversions, swim pace and grade-adjusted estimates.</li>
    <li><strong>Financial:</strong> Mortgages, loans, investments, retirement, taxes, salary, depreciation, budgeting and business metrics.</li>
    <li><strong>Health &amp; Fitness:</strong> BMI, calorie needs, body fat, heart rate, pregnancy dates, nutrition and clinical estimates.</li>
    <li><strong>Marketing &amp; Revenue:</strong> ROAS, CAC, LTV, CPC, CPM, CPA, conversion rate and profit margin.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Important disclaimers</h2>
  <p>Calculator results are estimates. Financial results are not investment, tax or legal advice. Health results are not medical advice, diagnosis or treatment recommendations. Marketing results are performance estimates, not guarantees. Always consult a qualified professional before making financial, health or business decisions based on calculator output.</p>
  <h2>Privacy first</h2>
  <p>All calculations happen in your browser. No calculator inputs are stored on our servers or linked to an account. We do not collect personal data through our calculators.</p>
  <p>CalcFino is an independent informational project. It is not affiliated with a race organizer, coaching body, watch company or healthcare provider.</p>
</InfoLayout>
